{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xQoJTRdxm11795090488.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天主教廈門教區為劉恆平主教舉行祝聖典禮，成為近四個月來內地第六位主教。</p><p></p><p>中國天主教網站公布，祝聖典禮周三在福建廈門一個天主教堂舉行，共500名神職人員及教友參加。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.CATHOLIC-1400_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263M1iBWqoUs1795092080.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>54歲的劉恆平聖名約瑟，現任福建省天主教愛國會及教務委員會副主任，今年6月當選為天主教廈門教區候任主教，是根據中梵主教任命臨時協議框架，在雙方溝通確認後獲任命，亦是近四個月以來，內地第六位獲祝聖的主教。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:57:35.759308+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:57:15.267205+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:50:54.681073+00:00","content_hash":"b03c5f971b55fcc768e3a29b9bb3151df4fb856cf262a6e1f8cec5ed2c92d702","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:57:35.759308+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}